                    Texts: [
                        {
                            Text: "You leave tracks a mile wide on fresh powder, friend. I saw you the moment you stepped onto the field - nothing hides on open snow. Battle before the cold decides for you."
                        },
                        {
                            Text: "The road to Nifl freezes the slow ones where they stand. My Piloswine will teach your team to keep warm the hard way."
                        },
                        {
                            Text: "You have a look the old northern lodges whisper about, the founder-face on the burned photographs. Do not answer. Answer on the field."
                        }
                    ],
                    Name: "Torvald Snowrunner",
                    Label: "default"
                }
            ]
